  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13.33px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\">(5 fotos) Diego L&oacute;pez Fern&aacute;ndez, Diego d&#39;Onda, ha aconseguit el XIV campionat individual de tecnificaci&oacute; d&#39;escala i corda, en imposar-se <span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">a Quique de la Pobla de Vallbona per un apretat 60-50, </span>a la final jugada la nit d&#39;quest dimecres a Massalfassar.</font></span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dieegolopezcampioindividualtecnificacio/final-1.jpg\" alt=\"final-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dieegolopezcampioindividualtecnificacio/final-2.jpg\" alt=\"final-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dieegolopezcampioindividualtecnificacio/final-3.jpg\" alt=\"final-3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dieegolopezcampioindividualtecnificacio/thumbnail_img_20190731_210026.jpg\" alt=\"thumbnail_img_20190731_210026\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dieegolopezcampioindividualtecnificacio/thumbnail_img_20190731_210058.jpg\" alt=\"thumbnail_img_20190731_210058\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
